  "conversionSteps": [
    "Parse the pinned original SentencePiece ModelProto; assert BPE, identity normalization, no dummy prefix, no whitespace collapse.",
    "Retain all original vocabulary IDs. Generate scored BPE merges only from NORMAL pieces using Transformers generate_merges.",
    "Replace literal ASCII spaces with U+2581. Enable byte fallback. Preserve USER_DEFINED pieces as normalized=true, special=false added tokens; matching after normalization preserves whitespace-only user pieces. Do not recognize CONTROL/UNUSED literals as special tokens.",
    "Omit postprocessing and BOS/EOS. Compare token IDs with the original SentencePiece runtime for every reference vector and 256 deterministic mixed-script samples.",
    "Compress JSON with gzip level 9 and deterministic mtime=0."
  ],
